# Repo root only. fe/, be/, launcher/ and scripts/ carry their own — this
# file covers what lands at the top level, which until now nothing did.

# A stray `npm install` or `pnpm install` run from the root rather than from
# be/ or fe/. 273 MB the first time it happened, and nothing here needs it:
# the backend's dependencies live in be/, the Tailwind build's in fe/.
node_modules/

# Screenshots taken while checking a page — see "Checking the page" in
# CLAUDE.md. They accumulate fast and are working files, not documentation.
# Anything worth keeping belongs in docs/ under a name that says what it shows.
scr-*.png

# LibreOffice writes these beside an open document and removes them on close.
# One was committed by accident, which is what it takes to notice them.
.~lock.*#

# Cargo, now that the workspace root owns the build directory. The per-crate
# .gitignore files still carry their own /target for anyone building a crate
# outside the workspace.
/target
/Cargo.lock.bak
